"program_narrative": "Program PORTREAD is a batch program that lists the contents of the portfolio master file. It opens the indexed PORTFOLIO-FILE (PORTFLIO record layout) for input and reads it sequentially from the beginning until end of file. For each record read it adds one to a record counter and displays the portfolio ID, account number, client name, status and total value. At the end it closes the file, displays the total number of records read and passes its return code to the caller. Error conditions handled: an OPEN failure is displayed with the file status and sets return code 8, but processing is not stopped at that point.",
